{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bid farewell to the mundane movie-watching experience! CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/Build_Screenshot_2025.06.19_-_22.43.27.06.png?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within the villa of your own design, you can freely construct your private home theater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.webm?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content. With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a variety of natural environments for players to select from, such as islands, waterfalls, and snow-capped mountains. Players can also modify lighting and sky settings to tailor the ambiance of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/image.png?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lighting and Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive lighting and fireplace flames allow you to switch and adjust the atmosphere to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/light_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Panoramic photo access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can further enhance their virtual reality environments by loading local panoramic photos as backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.webm?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1751616714","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1751616714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/d8b1e1417d3e3197c25986fbcda1616c8d457208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751616714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/d8b1e1417d3e3197c25986fbcda1616c8d457208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751616714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bid farewell to the mundane movie-watching experience! CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/Build_Screenshot_2025.06.19_-_22.43.27.06.png?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within the villa of your own design, you can freely construct your private home theater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.webm?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content. With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a variety of natural environments for players to select from, such as islands, waterfalls, and snow-capped mountains. Players can also modify lighting and sky settings to tailor the ambiance of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/image.png?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lighting and Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive lighting and fireplace flames allow you to switch and adjust the atmosphere to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/light_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1751616714\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Panoramic photo access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can further enhance their virtual reality environments by loading local panoramic photos as backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.poster.avif?t=1751616714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.webm?t=1751616714\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","developers":["PlanetariumStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/e10c09314335d0e5d7f184edd00c55f9acb731f6/header.jpg?t=1751616714","is_f